message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Throttled-ESCE Hybrid Load Balancer: reference implementation and CloudAnalyst experiments"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid VM load balancer for CloudAnalyst that combines Throttled and
  Equally Spread Current Execution policies with tri-level load thresholds,
  capacity-aware scoring and elastic scaling for heterogeneous cloud
  environments, together with the full experimental setup and reports.
